{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947890/extras/5e2596f864b17cf47102fb08c0dbeab4.poster.avif?t=1763128719\" width=624 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947890/extras/5e2596f864b17cf47102fb08c0dbeab4.webm?t=1763128719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947890/extras/5e2596f864b17cf47102fb08c0dbeab4.mp4?t=1763128719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Coffeehouse is a first-person management game - you play as an owner of small coffee business, and your task is to become the best place to get a coffee in this town!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Have you ever dreamed of owning a small place where you can sell coffee, tea, and cake to your lovely customers? Coffeehouse is exactly that! Take care of customer orders, make coffee, resolve customer problems and lose yourself in micromanaging. Soon, you're gonna become the biggest coffee boss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947890/extras/a4c8835057367cae649852f437fc3fa2.poster.avif?t=1763128719\" width=624 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947890/extras/a4c8835057367cae649852f437fc3fa2.webm?t=1763128719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947890/extras/a4c8835057367cae649852f437fc3fa2.mp4?t=1763128719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0Make heavy cream patterns. Each coffee is unique! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947890/extras/030ba32013000972f0033116b5353013.poster.avif?t=1763128719\" width=624 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947890/extras/030ba32013000972f0033116b5353013.webm?t=1763128719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947890/extras/030ba32013000972f0033116b5353013.mp4?t=1763128719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0Serve your masterpiece to the customers with various tastes and balance the profits! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947890/extras/0462d5dedfc44adb6927adbe88457f86.poster.avif?t=1763128719\" width=624 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947890/extras/0462d5dedfc44adb6927adbe88457f86.webm?t=1763128719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947890/extras/0462d5dedfc44adb6927adbe88457f86.mp4?t=1763128719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Customize your shop: buy furniture, paint the walls, and choose a theme for your shop! Retro or modern style? You decide! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947890/extras/768ceb05edb2a558ba01a62a300ec4e2.poster.avif?t=1763128719\" width=624 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947890/extras/768ceb05edb2a558ba01a62a300ec4e2.webm?t=1763128719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947890/extras/768ceb05edb2a558ba01a62a300ec4e2.mp4?t=1763128719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0Learn different ways to make coffee! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947890/extras/efb3c26eebf2f60d4eb45c263e6a7157.poster.avif?t=1763128719\" width=624 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947890/extras/efb3c26eebf2f60d4eb45c263e6a7157.webm?t=1763128719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947890/extras/efb3c26eebf2f60d4eb45c263e6a7157.mp4?t=1763128719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0Clean, do dishes and when you get tired of it - hire some help!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1947890?t=1763128719","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1947890?t=1763128719","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947890/8f1fe38716d7c4a89aa5603b7b2bc99c9600e793/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763128719","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/19478